<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Awande says still mulling Namibian listing.</title>
<headline>Awande says still mulling Namibian listing.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Awande Holdings Ltd said on Friday it is still considering making an application to the Namibian Stock Exchange for the separate listing of certain of its Namibian mining assets and operations.</p>
<p>Shareholders were advised to exercise caution in their sharedealings until a further announcement which is expected to be made around June 6.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
